iv>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">9.10<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 6, 2011<br/>Summer Update 2011</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20110705200442&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star_Ring_c9fde1.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a star ring <span class=\"p-attributes\">(faster regeneration)</span> <span class=\"p-duration\">that is brand-new</span>.<div class=\"p-reqs\">It can only be wielded properly by players without vocation.<br/></div><div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 0.80 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">If you wear it on your ring slot, it will boost your health regeneration when you're not hungry.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>As it's only wearable by players without a <a href=\"#/wiki/Vocation\">vocation</a>, it's only useful on <a href=\"#/wiki/Rookgaard\">Rookgaard</a>. It lasts for 10 minutes.\nObtained in <a href=\"#/quest/the-rookie-guard-quest\">The Rookie Guard Quest</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li>Quests</li><li>Rings</li><li>Rook Set</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Rookgaard\">Rookgaard</a></li><li>Rookgaard Equipment</li><li>Rookgaard Leveling Guide</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/the-rookie-guard-quest\">The Rookie Guard Quest</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["the-rookie-guard-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"the-rookie-guard-quest","quest":"The Rookie Guard Quest","step":"2-2","n":11,"title":"Entregar as ervas","kind":"reward","coords":[{"x":32137,"y":32171,"z":4,"label":"Hyacinth"}]}]}}